The derived parts were modified (rewritten in Python/JavaScript/QML):

  - bin/services.json: meeting-service URL patterns from
    MeetingBar/Meetings/MeetingProvider.swift (copied, reformatted as JSON)
  - Model.js: next-event selection, status-bar title and notification
    planning logic from Calendar/EventSelection.swift,
    UI/StatusBar/StatusBarPresentation.swift and
    Notifications/NotificationPlanner.swift (translated to JavaScript)
  - bin/kaigi-events: link-source ranking and redirect unwrapping from
    MeetingBar/Meetings/MeetingLinkDetector.swift (translated to Python)
  - i18n/ja.json, i18n/en.json: a few UI strings from MeetingBar's
    Localizable.strings (ja translation by Mitsukuni Sato)

